---
/* NEW DROPS NOTIFIER — 16 Oct. Replaces "no footer" on the shop sub-pages
   (product/collections/category/checkout/cart/all) with something lighter
   than the full site <Footer /> but not nothing: a single-row strip, not
   the dense multi-column grid Footer.astro carries. Copy is deliberately
   NOT the site's "Newsletter" text (Footer.astro: "Occasional notes on
   what the tribe is making. No spam, no sermons.") -- this is the shop's
   own drops list, reusing the copy already written for it in the original
   skeleton. Ink ground regardless of the page's own ground (ember or
   paper) so it reads as chrome closing the page out, the same job
   Footer.astro does elsewhere.

   No flare button here -- every page this sits on already has its own
   primary ask (Add to cart, Continue to payment, See more...), so this
   button stays plain ink-on-paper to keep flare at one element per
   screen, same rule the nav's `ctaMuted` exists for.

   17 Oct, motion pass: the submit handler set data-sent on the FORM, but
   shop.css's rule checked .shop-drops[data-sent] -- an ancestor that
   never actually got the attribute, so "Notify me" did nothing visible.
   Fixed to target the section, and the old instant display:none is now a
   crossfade to a confirmation line (CSS transition on the attribute
   toggle, not a keyframe -- same reasoning as the toasts in Sonner: a
   state that's set once, not re-triggered, still crossfades better than
   it snaps). */
---
<section class="shop-drops" aria-labelledby="drops-h" data-fade>
  <div class="shop-container shop-drops__inner">
    <div>
      <p class="shop-drops__k" id="drops-h">New drops</p>
      <p class="shop-drops__lead">Runs are small and most sell through in a week. The list goes out the morning a run opens.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="shop-drops__action">
      <form class="shop-drops__form" onsubmit="event.preventDefault(); this.closest('.shop-drops').dataset.sent='1';">
        <label class="visually-hidden" for="drops-email">Email address</label>
        <input id="drops-email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@studio.com" autocomplete="email" required>
        <button type="submit">Notify me</button>
      </form>
      <p class="shop-drops__sent" aria-live="polite">You're on the list.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
